      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Defaults: each query looks 2 days back (payments.collection_days_back per collector); the\nretry window is 15 days (payments.retry_days_back). A date that keeps coming back with no EOBs\nis retried until it ages out. Backoff base/cap are in DynamoDB config; a TimeoutCheck also\nexists (not traced).",
      "originalText": "Defaults: each query looks 2 days back (payments.collection_days_back per collector); the\nretry window is 15 days (payments.retry_days_back). A date that keeps coming back with no EOBs\nis retried until it ages out. Backoff base/cap are in DynamoDB config; a TimeoutCheck also\nexists (not traced).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
